Scope and exceptions
--------------------

The CC0-1.0 dedication above applies to the project's own original source (src/ except
src/third_party/, tests/, tools/, cmake/, docs/ and top-level build files). It does NOT
apply to the following, each of which retains its own license:

  * src/third_party/ — vendored single-file libraries under their upstream terms:
        - stb_image.h, stb_image_impl.c .... public domain (Nothings / Sean Barrett)
        - font8x8_basic.h ................... public domain (Daniel Hepper)
        - tsf.h, tinysoundfont_impl.c ....... MIT (see TinySoundFont.LICENSE)
        - tml.h, TinySoundFont.LICENSE ...... zlib license
    Keep the notices contained in those files intact. MIT and zlib require their
    permission/notice text to be preserved, so they cannot be relicensed to the public
    domain by this project.

  * The TimGM6mb MIDI soundfont (TimGM6mb.sf2) is fetched at build time by
    tools/fetch_soundfont.sh and is NOT distributed here. It is GPL-2.0; see
    TimGM6mb.LICENSE.txt produced by that script.

  * The original Well of Souls game data, installer and binaries are copyrighted by
    their respective owners, are NOT distributed in this repository, and are covered by
    no license here. Supply data you legally own; see tools/fetch_game_data.sh.

To the extent possible under law, the author makes no warranty about the Work and
disclaims all liability for its use.
